<title>UK: Commerzbank sets A$100 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets A$100 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    04.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.175   PAY DATE    04.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1/10/100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AUS</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    TAX PROVS  STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.5	 SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIP     0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
